    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bde554efead73014594f294d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我回想起了，\n出道战刚结束不久的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2aa14b18f6a620a800b1754ce074132159155efe98404ca663ff2188fd28e0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6a75fde55fc3d81854aec9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我和你的，重叠",
      "source_fingerprint": "040b4af31a66db590a1c4fb1d492ac1a0b316f92ca9d4b503b482cf216360c2d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d38ae177609066060bde458",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目她，\n达成了前所未有的芝GⅠ8胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f0082cbc9c2ae961ffdf1d2975883640c2dea4ee39e168e94ffd70752de3b0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbc63f7729f59a7b7959fc2b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是历史上，从未有人抵达过的境界――\n她终于，打破了那道“高墙”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b4a20734e2a2c9fdf9520084e7d0ec7f34c4baabefdcf47ece23517be7a7077",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acbe5613cf7ca1e8418450da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "话虽如此，我在与杏目的朝夕相处中，\n多少也有跟她一起训练过的自负。\n相信现在的我肯定――！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f69d7aa1748db3f6c62460cadc3bd48a46273ef1ab9c783e520bc523f1994307",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1edc15b6cbc74ccbc1db708a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咕嘟咕嘟咕嘟……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c2bd556d9b9717ad52ce31b6ab6b3a30708178523fc693c6385ed817decf3d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86626ac24ed9e8457c371e4a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（掉……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac4f55c89145f97740c5b2cdc0e4e4a419483c556ffb460c06b86b60e8245e86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fc71a39ac0e74ddbee45aed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――脑海中闪过各种记忆。\n大量的画面纷乱地流过……。\n其中，最为耀眼的光芒是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5b6da3ed1b3d12c64abf3bc10982d8fd1581a5e055d2e643db872ff348eb2f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c7ea02a4ab8eb319c1dd48f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实况",
      "source_fingerprint": "50349a592c466fb97eeafeb81fd3fa65c8c3b2e779463937300c4c8f97230140",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98bf62552bc6209611db7ed4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目！！\n越过了“皇帝”鲁道夫的高墙！！\n达成草地GⅠ8胜啦……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e66eb7723906460ede8ee51d7c2370b953110617ad06fb01eeab0ea95faf4ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64e6a11e7fdbc01be734bc30",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（哇啊啊啊……！！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d22a4d22939d22437e4d841f18b6273830d55d6dbcf0320be50b8369386b76a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e43874e1aea07f80ce3f1d4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（啊啊……多么、美妙啊――）",
      "source_fingerprint": "18002b2ceaa219108bbe1d9fce369eefe50f5123439cc40186faea7463b0592a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2612a7843dc27a23432282f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――在空荡荡的心里，伴随着实感……\n苏醒。沸腾了全场的热气、欢呼声……\n喜悦爆发的、杏天真无邪的笑脸……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86c50e697aecf336fede8c616a17cc6fe8fa31263fa76f219bf6de87391b789d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8570dd88650c4456b57bf375",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目",
      "source_fingerprint": "b632be927b5d52ab85b0cfae236cdc76e44b41d48ba6e925027a4013417d1d5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe0bedbd721cf98e4bab966f",
      "kind": "story",
